    "company_info": "Chalé São Miguel is a Brazilian hospitality brand offering chalet-style lodging in Itaperuna, a municipality in Rio de Janeiro. Operating in the short-term stay segment, it provides a cozy, home-like option for visitors seeking local accommodations.\n\nThe product is chalet accommodations under the Chalé São Miguel name, with inquiries and bookings routed through a link in the Instagram bio, indicating a straightforward, guest-friendly communication flow. The brand emphasizes a local, intimate lodging experience designed for easy access and direct contact.\n\nIts target audience comprises travelers and vacationers visiting Itaperuna who value a simple, comfortable stay. The tone across the page appears friendly and direct, aiming to facilitate easy communication and a localized guest experience in Itaperuna, RJ, Brazil."
  }
}

